			<tr><td class="windowbg2"> 
				As of this afternoon the transfer to the new site should be complete.  Now that we are using the www.gotteverquest.net domain here, please make sure you update your links accordingly.  If you are not using www.gotteverquest.net as opposed to guild.shadowfury.net, you will have problems with staying logged into the site.
					<p>-- TheNexus
</p>
